{"ref": "17:106", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2135.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And (it is) a Qur'an that We have divided, that thou mayst recite it unto mankind at intervals, and We have revealed it by (successive) revelation.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Sana Kur'ân'ı verdik ve onu insanlara sindire sindire okuyasın diye (kısımlara) ayırdık ve biz onu yavaş yavaş indirdik.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور قرآن ہم نے جدا جدا کرکے اتارا کہ تم اسے لوگوں پر ٹھہر ٹھہر کر پڑھو اور ہم نے اسے بتدریج رہ رہ کر اتارا", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan Al Quran itu telah Kami turunkan dengan berangsur-angsur agar kamu membacakannya perlahan-lahan kepada manusia dan Kami menurunkannya bagian demi bagian.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَقُرْءَانًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَرَقْنَٰهُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/143e0fb44b52bda1e653.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "razdijelili smo ga", "en": "We have divided it", "tr": "onu (Kur'an'ı) ayırdık", "fr": "Nous l'avons divisé", "id": "Kami telah membaginya", "ur": "ہم نے اسے جدا جدا کر دیا", "bn": "আমি তা আলাদা আলাদা করেছি", "fa": "ما آن را جدا جدا کرده‌ایم"}}, {"text": "لِتَقْرَأَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مُكْثٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَنَزَّلْنَٰهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَنزِيلًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "فَرَقْنَا", "count": 1, "first": "2:50", "audio": "audio/3363aa53047869bed630.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "we separated", "bs": "razdvojili smo", "tr": "ayırdık", "fr": "nous nous sommes séparés", "id": "kami telah memisahkan", "ur": "ہم نے جدا کیا", "bn": "আমরা পৃথক করেছি", "fa": "جدا کردیم"}}, {"arabic": "فَٱفْرُقْ", "count": 1, "first": "5:25", "audio": "audio/96ec21b905bc2a499f38.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}]}, {"arabic": "فَرَقْنَٰهُ", "count": 1, "first": "17:106", "audio": "audio/143e0fb44b52bda1e653.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"]}], "gloss": {"bs": "razdijelili smo ga", "en": "We have divided it", "tr": "onu (Kur'an'ı) ayırdık", "fr": "Nous l'avons divisé", "id": "Kami telah membaginya", "ur": "ہم نے اسے جدا جدا کر دیا", "bn": "আমি তা আলাদা আলাদা করেছি", "fa": "ما آن را جدا جدا کرده‌ایم"}}, {"arabic": "يُفْرَقُ", "count": 1, "first": "44:4", "audio": "audio/ea350e660e979b761f49.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": true, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it is separated", "bs": "biva razdvojen", "tr": "ayrılır", "fr": "il est séparé", "id": "dia dipisahkan", "ur": "وہ جدا کیا جاتا ہے", "bn": "তাকে পৃথক করা হয়", "fa": "جدا می‌شود"}}], "ayatFile": "ayat/0562.json", "ayatTranslations": {"en": "ayat/0562.en.json", "tr": "ayat/0562.tr.json", "ur": "ayat/0562.ur.json", "id": "ayat/0562.id.json"}, "sentences": [{"arabic": "فَرَقَ الْمُعَلِّمُ بَيْنَ الطِّفْلَيْنِ", "spoken": "audio/8e63e513bc41bdb2ed49.m4a", "tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "translation": {"bs": "Učitelj je razdvojio dvojicu dječaka.", "en": "The teacher separated the two boys.", "bn": "শিক্ষক দুই ছেলেকে আলাদা করলেন।", "fa": "معلم دو پسر را از هم جدا کرد.", "fr": "Le professeur a séparé les deux garçons.", "id": "Guru memisahkan kedua anak laki-laki itu.", "tr": "Öğretmen iki çocuğu ayırdı.", "ur": "استاد نے دو